<https://w3id.org/laderr#Threat> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Threat is an entity that can potentially cause harm to an Asset through its threat capabilities, by potentially exploiting the latter's Vulnerabilities."@en .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#exploits> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Defines the relationship where a Capability exploits a Vulnerability, meaning that when both are enabled, the Capability can trigger an adverse event through the Vulnerability."@en .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#exposes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Defines that a Vulnerability exposes a Capability, making it susceptible to threats."@en .
<https://w3id.org/laderr#scenario> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Associates a LaDeRR Specification with a Scenario Type that describes its operational context."@en .
